func=jag::PacketHandlers::PointlightExtendBelow	func_addr=0x001db7e0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=ServerProt handler op\e0x96, size\e3 (fixed). CATEGORY: Misc/PlayerList (UNCERTAIN). OPCODE NAME: UNKNOWN.\nPAYLOAD (3 bytes): [u8 mode][u8 hi][u8 lo]; coordKey \e (s16)(hi<<8 | ((lo-0x80)&0xff)).\nFLOW: scene \e Client+0x19558 (\e OClient.SCENE_MANAGER); idx \e scene+0x70 (CURRENT_WORLD_INDEX); world \e *((scene+0x58 [WORLD_ARRAY] + idx*0x10) + 8); if null -> return. FUN_006195e0(&vec, world, coordKey) collects every entity (shared_ptr) whose coord \e\e coordKey from the world's spatial hash at world+0xc01d0 (node->+0x10 obj has coordKey at +0x80, entity shared_ptr at node+8). For each entity in vec: if mode\e\e0xf1 -> clear flag entity+0x157\e0; else entity+0x156(bool)\e(mode\e\e0xff), and if entity+0x157\e\e0 set entity+0x157\e1. Then releases vec (FUN_009cb290).\nENGINE CALL CHAIN: SCENE_MANAGER(0x19558) WORLD_ARRAY(0x58)/CURRENT_WORLD_INDEX(0x70) -> world spatial-hash query -> per-entity flag toggle.\nEVIDENCE: (1) SceneManager offsets 0x19558/0x58/0x70 match Offsets.kt OClient.SCENE_MANAGER + OSceneManager.WORLD_ARRAY/CURRENT_WORLD_INDEX; (2) FUN_006195e0 collects entities by coordinate.\nHYPOTHESIS: bulk toggle of a 2-state flag (+0x156 bool, +0x157 active) on all entities at one scene tile. Modes: 0xff\eset-true, other\eset-false, 0xf1\eclear. Purpose (highlight / visibility / marker) and entity type (players?) unverified -> UNKNOWN, Misc provisionally.\nSELF-CHECK: cursor advances 1 + 2 \e 3 bytes. OK.\nENGINE NOTE: entity+0x156/+0x157 flag pair and world spatial-hash@+0xc01d0 not in Offsets.kt.
