func=jag::PacketHandlers::PointlightShadow	func_addr=0x001dc7f0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=ServerProt handler op\e0x81, fixed size\e3 (u8 mode, u16 effectTypeId where low byte is (raw-0x80)&0xFF). Cursor advances exactly 3 bytes (verified).\nSUBSYSTEM: same as op0xB6 - SceneManager(Client+0x19558) -> current World -> FUN_006195e0 collects all world effect-emitter instances with instance+0x80 \e\e effectTypeId.\nSEMANTICS: mode decoded as (raw + 0x80); low nibble: 0xF -> CLEAR bool override (instance+0x153\e0); 1 -> true; else false (instance+0x152 \e nibble\e\e1, +0x153\e1). Bit 0x10 of mode selects variant: when CLEAR (bit clear) or when SET (bit clear), additionally resets the instance's animation position: if def(instance+0xD8)->float+0x80 !\e 0 (animated def) then instance+0x114 \e (effective flag ? instance+0x118 : 0), where effective flag \e override(+0x152 if +0x153 set) else def+0xAE default. I.e. toggling this bool restarts/zeros the playback position unless the bit-0x10 "no-restart" variant is used.\nHYPOTHESIS (not confirmed): loop/play-direction-style animated-property override with optional animation restart. Canonical RS name unknown - family postdates the librs2client.so reference.\nDISCREPANCY: engine ServerProt.kt calls this NPC_SET_VIS_FLAG_A / Category.NPC_INFO - wrong subsystem.\nConfidence: wiring+behavior CERTAIN; semantic name UNKNOWN.
