func=jag::PacketHandlers::NpcInfo	func_addr=0x001d7b60	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=NPC WRONG-TILE KEY: PHASE 1 moveType 1\eWALK(gBit3 dir)/2\eRUN(gBit1 sub +1-2x gBit3 dir) is how a KNOWN, still-visible NPC walks tile-to-tile. If the server only ever sends phase1 hasUpdate\e0 (idle) or moveType 3 (remove) and re-adds via phase2, a moving NPC stays frozen at its add-tile then snaps on re-add \e appears at wrong/stale tiles. Server MUST emit phase1 moveType 1/2 for visible-NPC movement. coordW (add deltas) \e REBUILD_NORMAL body[6], default 7.
