func=jag::PacketHandlers::UpdateInvPartial	func_addr=0x00184320	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=ServerProt UPDATE_INV_PARTIAL (opcode 121, varShort). Applies changed slots to an existing container.\nHeader: g2 containerKey (BE) | g1 flags (same flags as UPDATE_INV_FULL).\nContainer \e GetInventory(mgr, containerKey, flags&1) or CreateInventory(...) if absent.\nThen, until read pos reaches endOffset (param_3), repeated slot records:\n  slotIndex: gSmart1or2 (1 byte if <0x80 else 2-byte BE & 0x7FFF)\n  g2 objId (wire \e objId+1; 0 \e empty -> clears slot, amount 0, no vars)\n  if objId!\e0: amount g1 (0xFF -> g4 BE int); if flags&2: g1 varCount then varCount x {g2 varId|g4 value}\nNot count-prefixed; self-delimited by the varShort length (endOffset).
