func=jag::PacketHandlers::PointlightEnabled	func_addr=0x001dd5a0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=ServerProt handler op\e0xCB, fixed size\e3 (u8 mode, u16 effectTypeId where low byte is (raw-0x80)&0xFF). Cursor advances exactly 3 bytes (verified).\nSUBSYSTEM: same as op0xB6 - SceneManager(Client+0x19558) -> current World -> FUN_006195e0 collects all world effect-emitter instances with instance+0x80 \e\e effectTypeId.\nSEMANTICS: mode decoded as (raw + 0x80); low nibble 0xF -> CLEAR bool override (instance+0x151\e0); else SET instance+0x150 \e (nibble\e\e1), +0x151\e1. Bit 0x10 \e "flag only" variant. Without bit 0x10, additionally jumps the instance's normalized progress: instance+0xE8 \e 0.9999f (DAT_00cb7508, if flag true) or 0.0001f (DAT_00cb6b30, if false), and applies the same animation-position reset as op0x81 (instance+0x114 \e +0x118 or 0, gated on def(+0xD8)->float+0x80 !\e 0, effective flag from +0x152/+0x153 override else def+0xAE).\nHYPOTHESIS (not confirmed): bool override (e.g. reverse/at-end state) that also seeks the effect's progress to start/end. Canonical RS name unknown - family postdates the librs2client.so reference.\nDISCREPANCY: engine ServerProt.kt calls this NPC_SET_VIS_FLAG_B / Category.NPC_INFO - wrong subsystem.\nConfidence: wiring+behavior CERTAIN; semantic name UNKNOWN.
