func=jag::ClientProt::SendDisplayInfo	func_addr=0x001a2d60	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=jag::ClientProt::SendDisplayInfo - emits ClientProt op52 WINDOW_STATUS (entry &DAT_015d3b70; RegisterAll: ClientProt(&DAT_015d3b70,0x34,6) \e> opcode 52, fixed 6 bytes). Wire: [p1 displayMode (2\eresizable / 3 if a focused fullscreen sub-window)] [p2 width] [p2 height] [p1 antialias/flag from client+0x140]. Sent via ConnectionManager::GetActiveConnection (whichever of lobby/game is connected). In the lobby->world capture it is the first ClientProt the client sends on the new world socket (right before op98 and REBUILD_NORMAL). NOT login-related. RE rs2client.948-5.
