func=jag::game::LocationContainer::Add	func_addr=0x00136050	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::LocationContainer::Add(LocationContainer *lc, shared_ptr<MapSquareLocation> *src). Writes the dynamic-spawn vector at LC+0x60..LC+0x70 (eastl::vector of {qword ctrl, qword ptr} shared_ptr entries, 16-byte stride).\n\nLOCATIONCONTAINER LAYOUT (verified on 948-2):\n  LC+0x00:        vtable (inline LCs at MS+0x270 vs Client+0x19490 standalone LC)\n  LC+0x08..0x10:  RB tree sentinel for STATIC cache-loaded locations (walked via eastl::rbtree::next)\n  LC+0x10..0x18:  RB tree root (begin of iteration)\n  LC+0x60..0x70:  DYNAMIC vector -- eastl::vector<shared_ptr<MapSquareLocation>>, written by LOC_ADD/LOC_PREFETCH/LOC_CUSTOMISE\n  LC+0xB0..0xB8:  MULTI vector -- {ctrl,ptr} stride 0x10, read by UPDATE_ZONE_FULL_FOLLOWS\n  LC+0xC8..0xD0:  PRIMARY vector -- {ctrl,ptr} stride 0x10; PRIMARY SCENE-OBJECT LIST for cache-loaded locations\n  LC+0xE0..0xE8:  TERTIARY vector -- {ctrl,ptr} stride 0x10\n  LC+0xF8..0x218: 5 sub-dispatch slots x 0x48 bytes; each slot: +0x28 vec.begin, +0x30 vec.end; entries have nested vec at section+0xA0..+0xA8 stride 0xC0.\n\nTWO INSTANCES EXIST:\n  1. Standalone 'current zone' LC at *(Client+0x19490) -- written by LOC_ADD/LOC_PREFETCH/LOC_CUSTOMISE/LOC_DEL handlers.\n  2. 50 INLINE LCs at MS+0x270..MS+0xEB30 (each 0x2E0 bytes) -- ctor vtable for inline LCs; populated from cache during MapSquare load; indexed via GetLocationContainerAt which walks the OUTER vector at MS+0xEB68..+0xEB70 (INITIALLY EMPTY).\n\nCRITICAL: the MS+0xEB68 outer vector is EMPTY by default after ctor. Either it is populated during cache load, or the inline LCs at MS+0x270 are accessed directly via address \e MS + 0x270 + (X/chunk * 8 + Y/chunk) * 0x2E0. The engine 'allSceneObjects' walker iterating MS+0xEB68 yields empty; the correct approach is to iterate the 50 inline LCs directly, reading PRIMARY (+0xC8..+0xD0), MULTI (+0xB0..+0xB8), TERTIARY (+0xE0..+0xE8), and DYNAMIC (+0x60..+0x70) vectors.\n\nENGINE WALKER FIX (SceneManager.kt LocationContainer.allSceneObjects): for DYNAMIC, read begin\eptr+0x60, end\eptr+0x68 (16B stride; shared_ptr.ptr at entry+0x8), count\e(end-begin)/16. For STATIC cache objects, additionally walk the rbtree at LC+0x8/+0x10 (sentinel-based eastl::rbtree::next); static-tree nodes are CombinedLocation with the same payload accessors as MapSquareLocation (shape@+0x14, coord1@+0xc, coord2@+0x10). There are NO fixed slots at LC+0x40..+0x220 -- the layout is a dynamic vector + an rbtree.
