func=jag::LoginManager::LoginStepHandleLoginData	func_addr=0x001cd360	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=PRIVILEGE NOTE: loginType(param_1+0x20)\e\e2 \e WORLD/GAME login (ends SetMainState 0x1e LOGGED_IN); else \e LOBBY (0x14). BOTH allocate a FRESH LoggedInPlayer at client+0x19b30. Field map (engine-verified): +0x08\eplayerRights, +0x48\eplayerIndex, +0x88\estaffModLevel. WORLD branch reads +0x08(rights) at wire offset 1 and +0x48(playerIndex) at wire offset 7 g2, but NEVER reads +0x88(staffModLevel) -> +0x88 stays at init -1. Shift-click teleport + dev world-click gate on +0x08 playerRights>0, so the world login MUST carry rights at wire offset 1.
