func=jag::graphics::GraphNode::AddChild	func_addr=0x00680cd0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=jag::graphics::GraphNode::AddChild — adds param_2 (child GraphNode) to param_1 (parent GraphNode). VERIFIED OFFSETS (match engine OGraphNode):\n- param_2 + 0xFC |\e 0x47 — sets dirty/posChanged/hasBounds bits on child (FLAGS \e 0xFC)\n- param_2 + 0x130 \e param_1 — writes parent pointer in child (PARENT \e 0x130, not in engine)\n- param_1 + 0x138 \e children vector begin (CHILDREN \e 0x138)\n- param_1 + 0x140 \e children vector end\n- param_1 + 0x148 \e children vector capacity\n- param_1 + 0x158 \e inline children buffer ptr (cannot be freed)\nPush pattern: 1. If end < cap: write child to *end, end +\e 8. 2. Else: reallocate vector (double capacity), memcpy, free old (unless it equals +0x158 inline buffer).\nCalled when populating the scene-graph tree; Locations are added to their containing parent's graphNode via this. The MapSquare callsite uses MapSquare+0x8 (MapSquare's GraphNode pointer) as the parent — confirming MapSquare is Entity-derived with GRAPH_NODE \e 0x8.
