func=jag::PacketHandlers::TelemetryGridValuesDelta	func_addr=0x000efd80	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=op186 (0xba) REBUILD_WORLDENTITY (varShort). Patches individual matrix cells of existing WorldList entries (Client+0x193d8). NOT npc-index sets - CORRECTED. Triple nested loop, each level terminated by 0xff:\n  outer  cVar2 \e worldId  (used as LIST INDEX: worldList.begin + worldId*0x68)\n  middle cVar7 \e srcRow   (matrix row index, into entry.matrix at +0x50)\n  inner  cVar8 \e destCol  (matrix column index)\n    for each (srcRow,destCol): [g4 value BE] written to matrix[srcRow].data[destCol].\nvalue \e same packed src-chunk descriptor as op199: (plane<<24)|(chunkX<<14)|(chunkY<<3)|(rot<<1).
