func=jag::PacketHandlers::UpdateInvFull	func_addr=0x001a8d30	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=ServerProt UPDATE_INV_FULL (opcode 85, varShort). Rebuilds a whole container.\nHeader: g2 containerKey (BE) | g1 flags | g2 slotCount (BE).\n  flags bit0 (&1) \e keyFlag -> 3rd arg of CreateInventory; internal mgr key \e containerKey*2 | keyFlag.\n  flags bit1 (&2) \e per-slot obj-var block present.\nContainer \e InventoryManager::CreateInventory(mgr@Client+0x19550, containerKey, keyFlag).\nThen slotCount records, DENSE for slots 0..slotCount-1:\n  g2 objId  (wire \e objId+1; 0 \e empty slot, stored as id-1)\n  amount: g1; if the byte \e\e 0xFF then g4 (BE int) follows (full amount)\n  if flags&2: g1 varCount, then varCount x { g2 varId (BE) | g4 value (BE int) } obj-vars\nTwo parallel per-slot arrays: inv[2]\e{int id,int amount} stride 8; inv[5]\eObjVarDomain stride 0x38.\nobj-var attached via VarDomain::FindOrCreateEntry(slotVarDomain, varId) -> int-typed variant value.
