func=jag::game::ConfigProvider::GetVarType	func_addr=0x005addf0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=jag::game::ConfigProvider::GetVarType. Looks up a VarType across all domains: checks enum field at this+0x3c \e\e 4, then selects one of seven domain type-lists (Player/NPC/Client/Clan/ClanSetting/World/PlayerGroup) by comparing domainTag against the domain-tag globals, and virtual-dispatches GetType(varId) through that list. Called from packet handlers (LoginProtocolHandler, LoginStepWaitingServerClientVar), script ops (SET_VARC_STR_SMALL), quest_varpreq_met, player_group_member_get_same_world_var, lc_get_multivar, etc.
