func=jag::PacketHandlers::UrlOpen	func_addr=0x000f7080	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=ServerProt URL_OPEN (opcode 0x13, payload -2 short-var). VERIFIED 100% via reference binding chain. Two-part browser open: thunk -> FUN_00496050 reads a leading flag byte, WordPack/Huffman CP1252->UTF8 decode; if flag\e\e1 decodes+appends a SECOND segment; result -> FUN_0048d730 -> FUN_00ae4380 \e system("/usr/bin/xdg-open '<url>'"). Body matches reference WebPage lambda#2 (isra_10672 @ librs2client 0x4ba940), which jag::ConnectionManager::ConnectionManager binds to ServerProt::URL_OPEN. ENGINE DISCREPANCY: engine ServerProt.kt lists 0x13 as UNKNOWN_19 (MISC) -> should be URL_OPEN (WebPage). Sibling: op0xbc \e SOCIAL_NETWORK_LOGOUT (single-segment variant).
