func=jag::PlayerEntity::ProcessExtendedInfo	func_addr=0x0015e290	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=jag::PlayerEntity::ProcessExtendedInfo. Reads 1..4 byte LE update-mask header, then dispatches 23 blocks in FIXED source order. EXPANSION BITS \e {0, 13, 22} (byte0 bit0 -> byte1; byte1 bit5(\eoverall 13) -> byte2; byte2 bit6(\eoverall 22) -> byte3). CONFIRMED 948 player mask (bit -> dispatch-order : identity): bit26 ord1 SPOT_ANIM_REMOVAL; bit18 ord2 transient-bool(player+0x1071); bit20 ord3 VARP-buffer; bit3 ord4 APPEARANCE(len+buf -> QueueExtendedInfoPacket -> SetAppearanceAsPlayer) [APPEARANCE MOVED 947 bit2 -> 948 bit3]; bit6 ord5 OVERHEAD_TEXT(gMedium type-dispatch); bit24 ord6 model-transform list(EulerToRotationMatrix); bit11 ord7 spotanim-slot(short+uint+byte); bit15 ord8 spotanim-slot; bit7 ord9 FORCED_MOVEMENT(SetForcedMovement) [947 bit4 -> 948 bit7]; bit14 ord10 chat-private(compound guard); bit25 ord11 spotanim-slot; bit16 ord12 spotanim-list(GetTypeBySlot); bit9 ord13 spotanim-2fld; bit1 ord14 FACE_DIRECTION(JagexAngleToRadians -> player+0x23c); bit23 ord15 spotanim-list; bit5 ord16 EXACT_MOVE(4x gSmart2or4s); bit19 ord17 spotanim-slot; bit12 ord18 OVERHEAD_OPACITY(player+0x1074) [947 bit8 -> 948 bit12]; bit2 ord19 spotanim-slot; bit10 ord20 CHAT_TEXT(ChatHistory::AddChat) [947 bit15 -> 948 bit10]; bit21 ord21 POSITION_COLOR(HSLToRGB -> player[0x32..0x34]); bit4 ord22 HITMARKS(gSmart1or2 list, 0x7fff/0x7ffe) [947 bit3 -> 948 bit4]; bit17 ord23 head-icon(byte+3 short). Bit8 unused.
