func=jag::minimenuactions::ThreeDView::DoOpNpc	func_addr=0x0015c280	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=jag::minimenuactions::ThreeDView::DoOpNpc (948-5). One builder, ProtEntry (param_2) selects opcode.\nOption index -> ClientProt opcode: OPNPC1\eop31, OPNPC2\eop32, OPNPC3\eop113, OPNPC4\eop63, OPNPC5\eop11,\nOPNPC6\eop121(examine), OPNPCT\eop86. Plain (else) wire \e size 3:\n [0-1] npcServerIndex (MiniMenuEntry+0x48) writeShortAdd (BE, low+128) -> server readUShortAdd\n [2]   ctrl-run flag writeByteSubtract (0x80-bit) -> server readUByteSubtract\nAnchor: op32\eattack means the tested NPC had Attack at option index 2.
