func=jag::PacketHandlers::MidiJingle	func_addr=0x001dafa0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	text=ServerProt handler op\e0x0f, size\e11 (fixed). CATEGORY: Misc/WorldData (UNCERTAIN). OPCODE NAME: UNKNOWN.\nPAYLOAD (11 bytes): [u8 height][u8 typeByte][u32 packedCoord -> BuildArea::DecodePackedCoord][u8 rotation][u32 id (byteswap-on-LE)].\nFLOW: mgr \e Client+0x195b8 (single-slot world-graphic manager). graphic \e FUN_00b0cd30(mgr, DAT_015c7b40, word DAT_00cb7239, id, 0, typeByte, 7, 2, height<<9, ((-rotation-0x80)&0xff)<<9, &coord, coord.x, 0x100, 0) \e scene animated-model factory. On success configures graphic: +0x44\e1.5f, +0x94\e0x19, +0x34 vec init, animation-frame-count compare vs mgr+0x2978; stores graphic at mgr+0x2988 and frame count at mgr+0x2978, dirty flag mgr+0x2984. Replaces/destroys previous single graphic.\nENGINE CALL CHAIN: BuildArea::DecodePackedCoord -> FUN_00b0cd30 (scene model spawn) -> single-slot store on Client+0x195b8 manager.\nEVIDENCE: (1) DecodePackedCoord gives ABSOLUTE world coord (not zone-relative); (2) creates a single replaceable animated scene model.\nHYPOTHESIS: spawns one global animated graphic/spotanim at an absolute world tile (cutscene/area effect). Category + canonical name NOT verified -> UNKNOWN, placed in Misc provisionally.\nSELF-CHECK: cursor advances 1+1+4+1+4 \e 11 bytes. OK.\nENGINE NOTE: single-graphic manager Client+0x195b8 (model@+0x2988, frameCount@+0x2978, dirty@+0x2984) not in Offsets.kt.
